WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A task narrows your view. Count the small gold dots. What else is moving?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In the classic basketball experiment, some viewers missed a fully visible visitor.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A later experiment changed something important: how quickly the unexpected object moved.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Fast surprises were easier to notice. The details of the task matter.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A powerful demonstration is not proof that a commercial audio track changes cognition.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Follow the studies. Try the free observation. Decide what format you need.
